contentText:
Teyana Taylor was honored with the Icon of the Year Award at the 2026 BET Awards on Sunday night (June 28).

Janet Jackson , who&#8217;s Taylor&#8217;s main artistic inspiration, made a surprise appearance to present the Harlem-bred polymath with the award, which caught Taylor off guard and saw her immediately break down in tears.

